  "wikitext": "{{Short description|Species of plant}}\n{{Speciesbox\n| image = \n| genus = Silene\n| species = nocturna\n| authority = L.\n| synonyms =\n}}\n\n'''''Silene nocturna''''' is a species of annual herb in the family [[Caryophyllaceae]] (carpetweeds). They have a self-supporting growth form and simple, broad leaves. Individuals can grow to 0.39 m.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Silene nocturna L. – Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/5200422|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref>\n\n== Sources ==\n{{Free-content attribution\n| title = Silene nocturna\n| source = Encyclopedia of Life\n| documentURL = https://eol.org/pages/5200422\n| license statement URL = https://eol.org/docs/what-is-eol/copyright-and-linking-policy\n| license = CC0\n}}\n\n== References ==\n{{Reflist}}\n{{Taxonbar|from=Q11154720}}\n\n[[Category:Silene|nocturna]]\n[[Category:Flora of Malta]]",
